## Recommendation

The strip, distinct count and neutral highlights make waiting asks prominent at 1280, 640 and 390 while preserving useful lifecycle space.
Zero collapses cleanly; one and many retain the reference height, and horizontal overflow prevents growing membership from consuming the Board.
The chevron communicates additional entries in the expanded desktop and narrow captures, with the collapsed-state evidence gap and adopted focus corrections noted above.
The additional visible default is Planned as the phone’s initial lifecycle column, including at zero; the brief now explicitly records this approved-screen change.
W-406’s cue/liveness and W-415’s shell behaviour remain intact, and I found no additional palette or layout redesign beyond the approved presentation.
